NOTE ON SCOPE
================================================================================
This MIT license applies ONLY to the Python source code in this repository
(directories cshell/ and scripts/) and to documentation we authored
(README.md, THIRD_PARTY.md, docs/). It does NOT cover:

  * The ControllabilityAnalysis and CalControlCentrality C++ packages by
    Yang-Yu Liu (Channing Division of Network Medicine, Harvard Medical
    School). Those tools are governed by their own license, which restricts
    redistribution. They are NOT included in this repository - users must
    obtain them directly from the original author. See THIRD_PARTY.md.

  * Pre-computed data files derived from those tools (e.g. *.linktype,
    *.nodetype, *.ControlCentrality). They are provided for convenience to
    reproduce the paper results; the underlying analysis methodology is
    credited to Liu et al. (Nature 2011; PLoS ONE 2012).
